(3, 4, "Shok turi va adrenergik vosita to‘g‘ri mos qo‘yilganlarini belgilang.",
 ["Anafilaktik shok — adrenalin mushak ichiga", "Septik shok — noradrenalin", "Kardiogen shok — dobutamin", "Spinal anesteziyadagi gipotenziya — fenilefrin yoki efedrin", "Anafilaktik shok — faqat prednizolon", "Septik shok — propranolol", "Kardiogen shok — prazozin", "Gipovolemik shok — faqat vazopressorlar, suyuqliksiz"],
 "Mark the correct matches between the type of shock and the adrenergic agent.",
 ["Anaphylactic shock — intramuscular adrenaline", "Septic shock — noradrenaline", "Cardiogenic shock — dobutamine", "Hypotension during spinal anaesthesia — phenylephrine or ephedrine", "Anaphylactic shock — prednisolone alone", "Septic shock — propranolol", "Cardiogenic shock — prazosin", "Hypovolaemic shock — vasopressors alone, without fluids"],
 "Gipovolemik shokda asosiy davo — suyuqlik va qon o‘rnini to‘ldirish; vazopressorlar faqat vaqtincha qo‘llanadi.",
 "In hypovolaemic shock the mainstay is fluid and blood replacement; vasopressors are only temporary."),
